goto pm_disable;
...
pm_runtime_disable(&pdev->dev);
```
Reason:
The fix introduces a new label `pm_disable` that ensures `pm_runtime_disable()` is called if the probe fails after `pm_runtime_enable()`. This balances the power management disable depth, preventing resource leaks or incorrect power management states.


